Dialogue: 4,0:22:42.65,0:22:45.85,EDJP - EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}晴れた日に
Dialogue: 4,0:22:45.85,0:22:50.45,EDJP - EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}雨なんて不思議だよね
Dialogue: 4,0:22:50.58,0:22:54.24,EDJP - EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}短いフレーズ
Dialogue: 4,0:22:50.58,0:22:54.24,EDJP - EP14,,0,0,18,,{\an9\fs44\fad(400,400)}笑いながら君が
