Dialogue: 4,0:22:38.90,0:22:42.65,EDCN - EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}我却仍想不起歌名
Dialogue: 4,0:22:42.65,0:22:45.85,EDCN - EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}晴朗的天气
Dialogue: 4,0:22:45.85,0:22:50.45,EDCN - EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}竟然会下雨 真不可思议呢
Dialogue: 4,0:22:50.58,0:22:54.24,EDCN - EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}简短的话语
Dialogue: 4,0:22:50.58,0:22:54.24,EDCN - EP14,,0,0,18,,{\an9\fs44\fad(400,400)}你脸上的笑颜
Dialogue: 4,0:22:54.33,0:22:57.70,EDCN - EP14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}不断反复着
Dialogue: 4,0:22:54.33,0:22:57.70,EDCN - EP14,,0,0,18,,{\an9\fs44\fad(400,400)}泪水滴落的瞬间
